{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>A Song of Ascents, of David. If not for YHWH</b> — this song too is like the sense of the song above." "<b>who was for us</b> — like \"was ours against our enemy\" [i.e. was on our side against our foe]." "<b>let him now say</b> — now, like every נא in Scripture."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 124, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:41:13.411241386Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}